{"4765350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "3D Cutie Character Creator", "steam_appid": 4765350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Cutie Character Creator is a Character Customization game where the player can dress up different characters, by choosing a variety of different things, such as makeup, hairstyles and clothing. By combining different garments and deciding their own colors, one can create an almost infinite number of unique designs and freely explore their own creativity. These characters can also be placed into the same world and interact with each other, making them come to life.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Cutie Character Creator is a Character Customization game where the player can dress up different characters, by choosing a variety of different things, such as makeup, hairstyles and clothing. By combining different garments and deciding their own colors, one can create an almost infinite number of unique designs and freely explore their own creativity. These characters can also be placed into the same world and interact with each other, making them come to life.</p>", "short_description": "A quick and easy to understand character customization game made in 3D. Choose between clothes, hairstyles, accessories and more, to create nearly infinite combinations. Finally, sit back and watch as your complete characters comes to life and can interact with one another.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765350/6397c803c3b90f3075ba61dc9ea923ff0d527fd1/header.jpg?t=1787561913", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765350/c5da70927d94bec23cb45a3b3ec3661b4de7b748/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787561913", "capsule_imagev5": "https://sh